<para id="X362000006X016J" category="J" type-id="30076" name-id="066OU-00" from="200708">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>ECU Power Source System</dtcname>
<subpara id="X362000006X016J_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00002OO00001">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>When the IG is turned ON, current from the MREL terminal of the engine control computer flows to the EFI MAIN relay, closing the EFI MAIN relay contacts and supplying power to the +B or +B2 terminal of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</content5>
</subpara>
